# Plan mode's layout, for before and after pictures of the dashboard.
# Plan: Bienvenida [image, video], Alabanza [pages, image],
# Lecturas [a live slot], Anuncios [nothing], Cierre [video]. The video
# is picked, so the preview shows it. A fresh data folder opens on the
# plans list, so ctrl+o goes back to the plan. Then Alabanza is folded.
wait 2500
section 5 Bienvenida
add fixtures/image.png
add fixtures/video.mp4
section 15 Alabanza
add fixtures/pages.pdf
add fixtures/image.png
section 10 Lecturas
slot !b jn 3
section 5 Anuncios
section 5 Cierre
add fixtures/video.mp4
go-on 2
loop 2 3
press ctrl+o
wait 2500
step 3
wait 2000
shot plan
fold 4
wait 1500
shot folded
quit
